Subject: [PATCH 4/4] build: drop device diagnostics from the system image

the settings entry only shows up when the diagnostics app resolves,
so dropping the package from the handheld system list removes both
the app and the menu.

Change-Id: I7ccaf43beb23bb2db1bd3473cb13b174ed02c518
---
 target/product/handheld_system.mk | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/target/product/handheld_system.mk b/target/product/handheld_system.mk
index 6bd76e6582..b154e3fc70 100644
--- a/target/product/handheld_system.mk
+++ b/target/product/handheld_system.mk
@@ -47,7 +47,6 @@ PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
     CertInstaller \
     CredentialManager \
     DeviceAsWebcam \
-    DeviceDiagnostics \
     DocumentsUI \
     DownloadProviderUi \
     EasterEgg \
